  "note": "value is the envelope in the fixtures/cbor description grammar; cbor_hex is its canonical KR-CBOR-1 encoding; json is the managed HTTP representation of the same envelope. An envelope is not signed: it carries objects that are, and adds nothing to what their signatures cover."
